{
    "background_story": "Rosa was a gentle sea nymph, born from the foam of the Aegean Sea. She was said to possess the power to communicate with the capricious sea goats, known as capros, that roamed the underwater caverns. According to legend, Rosa could calm the most ferocious of capros with a single melody, sung in a voice as sweet as the sirens. Her gift earned her the title of Capros Whisperer, and sea creatures from far and wide would seek her counsel. Rosa used her powers to maintain the delicate balance of the ocean's ecosystem, ensuring the capros and other sea creatures lived in harmony. Her legacy lived on, inspiring generations of sea nymphs to follow in her footsteps and protect the wonders of the deep.",
